@startuml
title v0.4 一次选课事务
actor Student
participant EnrollmentService
database PostgreSQL
Student -> EnrollmentService : enroll(studentId, classId, asOf)
EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : BEGIN
EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : SELECT teaching_class FOR UPDATE
EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : 查询学生、历史、同期记录
alt 外校学生
  EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : 查询生效协议与合作校已用名额
end
EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : 查询总容量
alt 全部规则满足
  EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : INSERT enrollment
  EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : COMMIT
  EnrollmentService --> Student : ENROLLED
else 任一规则失败
  EnrollmentService -> PostgreSQL : ROLLBACK
  EnrollmentService --> Student : 稳定拒绝码
end
@enduml
